@SmartX_Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7199

### Get all sensors
GET {{SmartX_Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a sensor
POST {{SmartX_Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF",
  "location": "Greenhouse Zone A",
  "category": "Temperature"
}

###

### Send telemetry
POST {{SmartX_Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF",
  "dataType": "Temperature",
  "value": 65,
  "unit": "C"
}

### Upload sensor attachment
POST {{SmartX_Api_HostAddress}}/api/attachments?sensorMacAddress=AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=SmartXBoundary

--SmartXBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sensor-log.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Smart-X sensor diagnostic log test.
--SmartXBoundary--


### Register Part 2 test sensor
POST https://localhost:7199/api/sensors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:02",
  "location": "Hydroponics Zone B",
  "category": "Temperature"
}



### Test 1 - Normal telemetry
POST https://localhost:7199/api/processing/enqueue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:02",
  "dataType": "Temperature",
  "value": 30,
  "unit": "C"
}

### Test 2 - Warning telemetry
POST https://localhost:7199/api/processing/enqueue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:02",
  "dataType": "Temperature",
  "value": 65,
  "unit": "C"
}

### Test 3 - Critical telemetry
POST https://localhost:7199/api/processing/enqueue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:02",
  "dataType": "Temperature",
  "value": 95,
  "unit": "C"
}


### Check queue status
GET https://localhost:7199/api/processing/status


### Process next telemetry job
POST https://localhost:7199/api/processing/next

### View processed telemetry history
GET https://localhost:7199/api/processing/history

  ### Verify sensor status after processing
GET https://localhost:7199/api/sensors







### Test 1: Activate critical alert
POST https://localhost:7199/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:02",
  "dataType": "Temperature",
  "value": 95,
  "unit": "C"
}

### Test 1: Check active alerts
GET https://localhost:7199/api/processing/alerts



###  — Test 2: Repeat critical reading
POST https://localhost:7199/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:02",
  "dataType": "Temperature",
  "value": 95,
  "unit": "C"
}

### Test 2: Verify no duplicate alerts
GET https://localhost:7199/api/processing/alerts

