### STEP 10.5 — Turn Pump ON
POST https://localhost:7199/api/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:02",
  "deviceType": "Pump",
  "action": "ON"
}

### STEP 10.5 — Check device states
GET https://localhost:7199/api/commands/states




### STEP 10.6 — Turn Relay ON
POST https://localhost:7199/api/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:02",
  "deviceType": "Relay",
  "action": "ON"
}

### STEP 10.6 — Check command stack
GET https://localhost:7199/api/commands/status

### STEP 10.6 — Check device states
GET https://localhost:7199/api/commands/states



### STEP 10.7 — Undo the most recent command
POST https://localhost:7199/api/commands/undo

### STEP 10.7 — Verify device states after undo
GET https://localhost:7199/api/commands/states

### STEP 10.7 — Verify undo stack
GET https://localhost:7199/api/commands/status

### STEP 10.7 — View command history
GET https://localhost:7199/api/commands/history
